<title>UK: London fertiliser fixtures.</title>
<headline>London fertiliser fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN - 50,000 tonnes urea Odessa/China $21.50 fio 5,000/4,000 shex 15-20/3 Grand International.</p>
<p>TBN - 20,000 tonnes bulk urea Point Lisas/Argentina $10 basis 1-1 or 11.50 basis 1-2 fio 4,000/1,500 15-20/3 Gorali.</p>
<p>Pacnav TBN - 20,000 tonnes dap Lazaro Cardenas/Manzanillo $6 fio 6,000 shex/2,500 shex 17-20/3 Fertinal.</p>
</text>
